                "text": "O-K! They have a \u201csketch of a plan.\u201d Wait it will be out in \u201ca few weeks\u201d. And it will be \u201cpages and pages and pages of ideas\u201d\u2026\n\nGOP \u201chealth plan\u201d sounds a lot like a middle schooler who failed to do his homework since 2010.",
