                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We were joined by the Lake Nona Research Council for #CoffeeWithTheCongressman.\n\nWe discussed their advanced medical research in Alzheimer\u2019s, aerospace, tropical diseases, and more.\u00a0We are honored to support NIH, VA, and DOD grants to help fund their research & ensure we are protecting ACA health coverage for their patients.",
