                "quoted_status_profile_username": "atrupar",
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In 5 days, 24.3 million of Americans will see their healthcare spike by 75% or more. Other health plans will spike too.\n\nThey can try to silence us but the clock is ticking to #SaveObamacare! \u23f0",
