                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Met with Alan Cares Health Insurance in Kissimmee to discuss how ACA cuts are hurting clients. Premiums are DOUBLING or TRIPLING next year, forcing many to lose coverage.\n\nWe can change this with a bipartisan agreement to extend the Premium Tax Credit & save Obamacare. https://t.co/2vj3g0A7aD",
