                "text": "We spoke with Lizbeth from Kissimmee, a small biz owner whose employer healthcare plan could go up 30% this year due to Obamacare cuts.\n\nIf over 100K constituents lose their healthcare, health insurance will go up for everyone else too. This is why we fight to #SaveObamacare. https://t.co/MdmhzOxLad",
