                "text": "After developing a \u201cConcept of a Plan\u201d, Trump is now in the \u201cEarly Ideation Phase\u201d of his health plan. \n\nHe jacked up Obamacare, cut $1T from Medicaid & still doesn\u2019t have a clue what he\u2019s doing.",
